   "year": 2026,
   "url": "https://slsa.dev/spec/v1.2/",
   "toc_urls": [
    "https://slsa.dev/spec/v1.2/",
    "https://slsa.dev/spec/v1.2/about",
    "https://slsa.dev/spec/v1.2/build-track-basics",
    "https://slsa.dev/spec/v1.2/terminology",
    "https://slsa.dev/spec/v1.2/build-requirements",
    "https://slsa.dev/spec/v1.2/verifying-artifacts",
    "https://slsa.dev/spec/v1.2/provenance",
    "https://slsa.dev/spec/v1.2/build-provenance",
    "https://slsa.dev/spec/v1.2/threats"
   ],
   "why": "节点现有英文资源就是这份规范；供应链安全领域的行业共识规范，按 Build/Source 两条轨道加跨轨道信息组织，覆盖制品、构建溯源与供应链完整性。每页都有自己的小节（该页的 On this page 列表），本轮据此把每个分支补到节一级。"
  },
  {
   "key": "B",
   "kind": "docs",
   "title": "reproducible-builds.org Documentation",
   "by": "Reproducible Builds project",
   "year": 2026,
   "url": "https://reproducible-builds.org/docs/",
   "toc_urls": [
    "https://reproducible-builds.org/docs/"
   ],
   "why": "补“可复现构建”与“依赖锁定”：SLSA 只要求可溯源，不解释什么算可复现，这个项目官方文档按 Introduction / Achieve deterministic builds / Managing variance / Define a build environment / Distribute the environment / Verification 六组组织页面，给出定义、不可复现的成因与固定/记录构建环境的做法。"
  },
  {
   "key": "C",
   "kind": "docs",
   "title": "OWASP CycloneDX Authoritative Guide to SBOM",
   "by": "OWASP Foundation / CycloneDX project",
   "year": 2026,
   "url": "https://cyclonedx.org/guides/OWASP_CycloneDX-Authoritative-Guide-to-SBOM-en.pdf",
   "toc_urls": [
    "https://cyclonedx.org/guides/OWASP_CycloneDX-Authoritative-Guide-to-SBOM-en.pdf"
   ],
   "why": "补“软件物料”：SLSA 规范里没有 SBOM 专门的章节，这份 OWASP 项目的权威指南讲清了 SBOM 的对象模型、覆盖度/成熟度（NTIA 最低要素）与使用场景。"
  }
 ],
